          <h4 style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: var(--tg-gold); font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 800; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
            📱 Tap to Play Video &bull; Reprogram to Your Own Message Anytime!
          </h4>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--tg-text);">
